🏠 Affordable Housing Data Accelerator

📌 Overview
This repository provides an accelerator for building and exploring a sample application that captures affordable housing data.
It serves as a starting point for:
  Extending the schema
  Enhancing the model-driven application
  Building additional user interfaces, automations, and integrations

Includes the sample app and schema for quick deployment
Schema Definition - Defines the data structure for the application
Lab Guides - Step-by-step instructions for hands-on learningSample DataPre-populated data for testing and demonstrations

✅ Lab Guide Topics

Power Automate
Model-Driven Application
Table Creation
Forms and Views


🚀 Getting Started

Import the Solution File into your environment.
Review the Schema Definition for data structure details.
Follow the Lab Guides to build and customize your application.
Use Sample Data to validate and demonstrate functionality.


🔗 Resources

https://learn.microsoft.com/power-platform
https://learn.microsoft.com/power-apps/maker/data-platform/data-platform-intro


🛠 Prerequisites

Microsoft Power Apps environment
Power Automate license
Basic understanding of Dataverse tables and forms


